t":8},{"category":"Vegetarian","historical_business_count":1}],"history":[{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood, Vegetarian","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Mediterranean, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"WNhcS2zi4zAqA2TbduVINQ","review_id":"ZV9PeiNbOBtR0NoKKZ4FRA","date":"2016-04-08T17:26:01","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.942448079586029,"text_excerpt":"I ate here last night and I couldn't wait to write a review! Don't be fooled by the fact that the restaurant is basically in a convenience store- they serve fantastic food! We started with the stuffed grape leaves and the falafel and both dishes were exceptionally good! I loved the grape leaves because they were cooked well and had a lot of flavor. For my entree, I got my go to- the beef shawarma which came with salad and hummus. I know that I get this as every Mediterranean restaurant, but it's my favorite and it's how i know if I like a place. Cleo's version didn't disappoint. The beef was nice and tender, the salad was good and the hummus was perfect. I like when the hummus is finely w..."},{"business_id":"WNhcS2zi4zAqA2TbduVINQ","review_id":"iUnt7FH4XK-ovkIEqtcb4g","date":"2016-07-26T17:52:59","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9344044923782349,"text_excerpt":"I love this place. The set-up Is weird as hell but the food is great and all the staff are nice and friendly too! Walking in, you're faced with a convenience store on the right and restaurant seating to the left. The convenience store feels like it's been lifted straight from a gas station. As I said, weird. Anyway, sit down and they will bring you a menu. There is lots to choose from. The hummus is great, really creamy, tons of flavor and comes with pita. The falafel is excellent, you get a great flavor from the herbs and the chickpeas themselves aren't blended too much, there's still a good amount of flavor. Also on the positives, they don't feel at all oily. One of the other dishes I g..."},{"business_id":"WNhcS2zi4zAqA2TbduVINQ","review_id":"2-xawBeI1rrSrn5zVbpIOg","date":"2013-09-25T03:18:27","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9292474389076233,"text_excerpt":"I've received great service every time I've walked in here. The place is divided into a cafe and a convenience store. They carry some cool things...a good mix of Middle Eastern goods and American stuff. The cafe has a large menu with pretty good prices. The food is authentic and made fresh. I've tried the eggplant sandwich (not sure if that's the actual name) and the falafel sandwich. The eggplant sandwich s ehh....Falafel sandwich is very good and fills you up. My favorite part about this place....it's open 24/7...meaning 1 more place to get a quality mid-night meal!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"WNhcS2zi4zAqA2TbduVINQ","photo_id":"M-3SdW8Z7w-3IPg4EkObrw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/M-3SdW8Z7w-3IPg4EkObrw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8770869970321655},{"business_id":"WNhcS2zi4zAqA2TbduVINQ","photo_id":"NS9Ss4yHcpgPObd5Ab2-tQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/NS9Ss4yHcpgPObd5Ab2-tQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8565985560417175},{"business_id":"WNhcS2zi4zAqA2TbduVINQ","photo_id":"s1bwsexCdHT1F9lxS5OTgQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/s1bwsexCdHT1F9lxS5OTgQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8314951062202454},{"business_id":"WNhcS2zi4zAqA2TbduVINQ","photo_id":"EjM3lRe1GGcogU__rLyFmg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/EjM3lRe1GGcogU__rLyFmg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7490581274032593},{"business_id":"WNhcS2zi4zAqA2TbduVINQ","photo_id":"OYp_oCJX939hBOaZ33RKgA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/OYp_oCJX939hBOaZ33RKgA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.708412766456604}]},"notebook_case":null}
